{"id":"80d65d51b3b48a04","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-matrices.md","title":"Matrices","display":"df-matrices — Matrices","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-matrices","aliases":["93-df-matrices"],"display":"df-matrices — Matrices","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-matrices"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-matrices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-matrices — Matrices"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a designated-set candidate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> is a matrix candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Matrix}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Matrix}_{93}\\)</span> (logical-matrix predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}matrices}\\vdash \\mathrm{Matrix}_{93}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\exists F\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle\\mathfrak A,F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land F\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}matrices}\\vdash \\mathrm{Matrix}_{93}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\exists F\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle\\mathfrak A,F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land F\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A logical matrix is the pair of an algebra and its designated set. Its one-place predicate now quantifies the algebra's complete similarity type instead of depending on a hidden <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Matrix}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}matrices}\\vdash \\mathrm{Matrix}_{93}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\exists F\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal M=\\langle\\mathfrak A,F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land F\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":990,"backlinks":[{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-matrices]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce"]}